  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1735526793_2995109_b912376b3fa2e09c8401acb544174b38.png",
  "description": "<div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow\">\r\n<div data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" class=\"min-h-8 text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"4d553d71-d562-430d-8cec-68655e305f8c\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\r\n<p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong><br>At Poshps, we believe in the power of animal companionship to support mental health and well-being. As a female-owned brand, we&rsquo;re dedicated to advocating for overcapacity shelters and helping animals find loving homes. Each of our products reflects our mission to make a difference, encouraging our community to support shelter pets one purchase at a time.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong><br>Our comfy crewnecks are crafted from ethically grown cotton, prioritizing both comfort and sustainability. Designed with a relaxed fit and soft, cozy feel, they&rsquo;re perfect for everyday wear and made to last. Each crewneck represents a step towards supporting shelter animals and spreading awareness of mental health through the companionship of pets.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>With every purchase, customers are directly supporting shelter pets and advocating for mental health, making our crewnecks more than just apparel. We bridge fashion and purpose, inviting people to join our movement that champions animal companionship as a unique form of mental health support.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><br>We offer secure and flexible payment options, including major credit cards, PayPal, and Apple Pay, as well as interest-free installment plans for larger purchases.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong><br>Each purchase includes a thank-you card sharing how your support is making an impact. Stay connected with us on Instagram for updates on shelter initiatives and stories of transformation, and see firsthand how your purchase brings comfort and companionship to animals in need.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
